  "components": [
    {
      "name": "주 버튼",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "금색 채움 행동 버튼. 맛보기 · 담으러 가기.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-btn-gold\" href=\"#\">맛보기 시작<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-gold{font-family:'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,system-ui,sans-serif;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;min-height:62px;padding:0 26px;border-radius:12px;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em;text-decoration:none;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffd700,#ffa500);color:#1d1500;box-shadow:0 10px 30px -12px rgba(255,170,0,.55);transition:transform .18s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),box-shadow .18s}.ds-btn-gold svg{transition:transform .18s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}.ds-btn-gold:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 16px 36px -14px rgba(255,170,0,.7)}.ds-btn-gold:hover svg{transform:translateX(3px)}.ds-btn-gold:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #ffc61a;outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "외곽선 버튼",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-outline",
      "description": "금색 외곽선 보조 행동. 가격으로 시작 · 계좌이체.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-btn-line\" href=\"#\">월 19,900원으로 시작<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-line{font-family:'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,system-ui,sans-serif;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;min-height:62px;padding:0 26px;border-radius:12px;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em;text-decoration:none;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,198,26,.7);color:#ffc61a;background:#0a0a0f;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;transition:background .18s,border-color .18s}.ds-btn-line svg{transition:transform .18s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}.ds-btn-line:hover{background:rgba(255,198,26,.07);border-color:#ffc61a}.ds-btn-line:hover svg{transform:translateX(3px)}.ds-btn-line:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #ffc61a;outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "VS 비교 판",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "vs-board",
      "description": "이 체계의 얼굴. 상대편은 흐리게, 우리 쪽은 밝게 + 나은 점, 위에 실측 칩.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-vs\"><div class=\"ds-vs-chip\"><span>문화누리카드 잔액</span><i></i><span>검색량 <b>7,180</b></span><i></i><span>문서수 <b>16,294</b></span><i></i><span>실측</span></div><div class=\"ds-vs-cols\"><div><h3>고수 글 5편 중 1편</h3><div class=\"ds-vs-row theirs\">문화누리카드 취소 환불 2026, 잔액은 언제 돌아오나요?</div></div><div class=\"ds-vs-mid\"><span>VS</span></div><div><h3 class=\"ours\">LEWORD 제목</h3><div class=\"ds-vs-row ours\">문화누리카드 잔액 확인법, 발급 대상과 연 15만 원 지원 기준<span class=\"ds-vs-edge\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19V5M6 11l6-6 6 6\"/></svg><span>고수 5명이 안 다룬 '조건·자격'까지</span></span></div></div></div><p class=\"ds-vs-foot\">애드센스 고수 벤치마크 실제 카드 · 2026-10-07 기준</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-vs{font-family:'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,system-ui,sans-serif;word-break:keep-all;position:relative;margin-top:24px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);border-radius:20px;background:#12121a;padding:38px 30px 30px;color:#f4f6fb}.ds-vs-chip{position:absolute;top:0;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;white-space:nowrap;padding:11px 22px;border-radius:12px;background:#0d0d14;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);color:#44d7b6;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-vs-chip b{color:#7be9cf;font-weight:800}.ds-vs-chip i{width:3px;height:3px;border-radius:50%;background:#7c8597}.ds-vs-cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 64px 1fr}.ds-vs h3{margin:6px 0 18px;text-align:center;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#aab2c2}.ds-vs h3.ours{color:#ffc61a}.ds-vs-row{min-height:108px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:16px 20px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09)}.ds-vs-row.theirs{background:rgba(255,255,255,.025);color:#7c8597;font-size:16px}.ds-vs-row.ours{background:#0f0f17;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.16);font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5}.ds-vs-edge{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px;color:#ffc61a;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:600}.ds-vs-edge svg{flex:none;margin-top:2px}.ds-vs-mid{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.ds-vs-mid span{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#0d0d14;border:1.5px solid #ffc61a;color:#ffc61a;font-weight:800;font-size:17px}.ds-vs-foot{margin:16px 0 0;color:#7c8597;font-size:13.5px;text-align:right}"
    },
    {
      "name": "실측 칩",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip-measured",
      "description": "재서 얻은 숫자 · 확인 가능한 사실만 싣는 민트 띠.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chip\"><span>검색량 <b>7,180</b></span><i></i><span>문서수 <b>16,294</b></span><i></i><span>실측</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{font-family:'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,system-ui,sans-serif;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;padding:11px 22px;border-radius:12px;background:#0d0d14;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);color:#44d7b6;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-chip b{color:#7be9cf;font-weight:800}.ds-chip i{width:3px;height:3px;border-radius:50%;background:#7c8597}"
    },
    {
      "name": "탭 알약 · 화면 바꿔 보기",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "switch-pill-active",
      "description": "띠가 보여 주는 실제 탭 이름(누를 수 없음)과, 같은 모양의 화면 바꿔 보기 단추(고른 것은 금색).",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-pills\"><span class=\"ds-pill\">키워드 분석</span><button class=\"ds-pill ds-switch\" aria-pressed=\"true\">황금키워드</button><button class=\"ds-pill ds-switch\" aria-pressed=\"false\">오늘의 글감</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.ds-pill{font-family:'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,system-ui,sans-serif;word-break:keep-all;padding:7px 13px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);color:#f4f6fb;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:600;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03)}.ds-switch{font:inherit;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;min-height:40px;color:#aab2c2;transition:color .18s,border-color .18s,background .18s}.ds-switch:hover{color:#f4f6fb;border-color:rgba(255,198,26,.45)}.ds-switch[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{color:#ffc61a;border-color:#ffc61a;background:rgba(255,198,26,.08)}.ds-switch:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #ffc61a;outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "증거 바로가기",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "proof-link",
      "description": "첫 화면 아래 3칸 — 후기 · 수익 인증 · 웹/PC 앱으로 가는 링크.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-proof\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-proof-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4z\"/><path d=\"M12 7.6l1 2 2.2.3-1.6 1.5.4 2.2-2-1-2 1 .4-2.2-1.6-1.5 2.2-.3z\"/></svg></span><span><strong>구매 후기</strong><span>실제 구매자가 남긴 후기</span></span><span class=\"ds-chev\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span></a>",
      "css": ".ds-proof{font-family:'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,system-ui,sans-serif;word-break:keep-all;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:22px 24px;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);background:rgba(18,18,26,.6);color:#f4f6fb;text-decoration:none;max-width:420px;transition:border-color .18s,background .18s}.ds-proof:hover{border-color:rgba(255,198,26,.45);background:rgba(22,22,34,.8)}.ds-proof:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #ffc61a;outline-offset:3px}.ds-proof-icon{flex:none;width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,198,26,.35);color:#ffc61a}.ds-proof strong{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em}.ds-proof span span{color:#aab2c2;font-size:15px}.ds-chev{margin-left:auto;color:#7c8597;display:flex}"
    },
    {
      "name": "실제 화면 액자",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "shot-frame",
